# Read-only nearby safe waypoint preview parameters.
#
# The provider must validate all values before use.
# This tool must not modify x3_waypoints.json.
# This tool must not send navigation goals.
# This tool must not publish /cmd_vel.

float64 min_radius
float64 max_radius
float64 step_radius
int32 angles
float64 window
int32 goal_cost_limit
float64 plan_tolerance
bool strict_high_cost
---
# JSON result string.
#
# The result should contain:
# - validated input parameters
# - current AMCL pose
# - costmap metadata and candidate-window evidence
# - candidate totals and accepted candidates
# - make_plan pose counts
# - failure statistics
# - explicit read-only safety evidence
std_msgs/String result_json
